gametitle=The Sims 2 (PAL-M) (SLES-53718) E626181E
// The remaster's own patch section (this repo). The [50 FPS] and [Widescreen 16:9] sections come from PCSX2's public patch
// collection (github.com/PCSX2/pcsx2_patches), downloaded at install by scripts/pnach.py fetch: they are not kept here.

[Aspect from memory]
author=remaster (local)
description=The game's aspect ratio function (0x3DB168) reads its value from the word at 0x3DB17C (padding after it), which the runner sets for 4:3, 16:9 or 21:9 (PS2_ASPECT). Default there: 16:9. Use instead of [Widescreen 16:9].
